WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:01.220
- [TARAJI] This is the part of the show

00:00:01.220 --> 00:00:03.570
where Kelly shares something wonderful

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:05.600
from the world of social media.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.400
Now it's my turn.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.171
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:09.171 --> 00:00:12.550
(upbeat music)

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:15.720
One thing to know about
me, I'm a hair chameleon.

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:17.190
That's my personality,

00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:21.000
from braids, knots, to
body weaves and blowouts.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.330
I've done it all.

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:24.660
And it's led me to create my own line

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:27.200
of products called TPH by Taraji.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:29.960
That's why I'm excited
about this next story.

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:32.120
Three sisters in Buffalo, New York

00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:35.140
have opened the city's
first black female owned

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:36.450
beauty supply store.

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:38.820
It's called The Hair Hive.

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:42.123
The sisters are dialed in, but, get this,

00:00:42.123 --> 00:00:44.170
(Taraji laughs)

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:46.513
they think they're talking to Kelly.

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:48.833
Let's surprise them.

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:51.213
Surprise!

00:00:53.581 --> 00:00:54.781
- Hi!

00:00:54.781 --> 00:00:57.781
[TARAJI] (laughing)

00:00:58.643 --> 00:01:01.900
Hi, Lauren, Brianna, and Danielle. Hi!

00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:02.847
How are you?

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:05.610
Obviously, Kelly's not here today.

00:01:05.610 --> 00:01:08.290
So, she invited me to host her show,

00:01:08.290 --> 00:01:10.710
and I'm excited to talk to you guys.

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:12.750
Congratulations on the store.

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:13.792
This is huge!

00:01:13.792 --> 00:01:15.119
(audience cheering)

00:01:15.119 --> 00:01:16.197
- Thank you.

00:01:16.197 --> 00:01:17.030
- It wasn't easy, was it?

00:01:18.514 --> 00:01:20.040
- It was not easy at all.

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:22.738
We actually opened in March of 2020

00:01:22.738 --> 00:01:26.300
and we had to close just a
month later due to the pandemic.

00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:28.000
So, we really had to shift

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.410
and figure out how can we be successful

00:01:30.410 --> 00:01:32.830
in a pandemic that we
didn't know was coming.

00:01:32.830 --> 00:01:34.970
So we started selling PPE in our store,

00:01:34.970 --> 00:01:37.030
essential products for the pandemic,

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:38.400
and were able to open

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:40.230
and be designated as
an essential business.

00:01:40.230 --> 00:01:42.630
And it kinda propelled us
in a different direction,

00:01:42.630 --> 00:01:44.930
because a lot of people that
didn't know we were here,

00:01:44.930 --> 00:01:46.110
started coming to our store

00:01:46.110 --> 00:01:48.910
because we were the only
beauty supply store open.

00:01:48.910 --> 00:01:50.530
- Yeah, not only were we essential

00:01:50.530 --> 00:01:54.520
because, you know, it was
the middle of a pandemic

00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:57.480
but we kind of designated
ourselves as essential

00:01:57.480 --> 00:02:00.080
because we were a black
owner in the community,

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:02.923
and we actually had representation out.

00:02:02.923 --> 00:02:04.160
- That's amazing.

00:02:04.160 --> 00:02:05.420
I'm gonna let you ladies know,

00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:08.080
I kept my local beauty salon store afloat

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:09.690
the entire pandemic.

00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:11.650
- She looking for me now.

00:02:11.650 --> 00:02:12.647
I'm like, "Girl, I'm back at work."

00:02:12.647 --> 00:02:14.321
"I can't come in."

00:02:14.321 --> 00:02:18.770
What I love is that you also
teach classes to the community.

00:02:18.770 --> 00:02:19.603
Is that right?

00:02:19.603 --> 00:02:20.830
Tell us about that.

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:23.480
- Yes. And we do, we have
a nonprofit organization

00:02:23.480 --> 00:02:25.470
called "The Hair Hive Learning Lab"

00:02:25.470 --> 00:02:27.330
and it's for ages 12 to 17.

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:29.770
It's a six week course and it is free

00:02:29.770 --> 00:02:32.590
but we do run on donations
from the community and beyond

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:35.750
and we teach, weaving,
cutting, braiding, dying

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:36.583
all of that.

00:02:36.583 --> 00:02:39.050
And we also teach you how
to start and run a business.

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:41.040
- [TARAJI] Oh my goodness, ladies.

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:42.423
That is beautiful.

00:02:44.350 --> 00:02:47.070
Thank you so much, Lauren,
Brianna, and Danielle.

00:02:47.070 --> 00:02:51.190
I'm liking your post
right now. That's not all.

00:02:51.190 --> 00:02:55.110
Our season-long partner,
Pilot Pen, makers of G2.

00:02:55.110 --> 00:02:57.540
The go-to pen of The Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:02:57.540 --> 00:03:00.960
want to honor ultimate
overachievers, just like you.

00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:04.861
So they'll be writing
you a check for $1,000.

00:03:04.861 --> 00:03:06.169
- Wow!

00:03:06.169 --> 00:03:08.870
- [TARAJI] One more thing, one more thing.

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:12.920
As a female entrepreneur, I
love the work you're doing

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:14.960
with the store and the community.

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:16.950
That's the biggest part
for me, teaching babies

00:03:16.950 --> 00:03:19.210
how to make wigs, honey. I love it!

00:03:19.210 --> 00:03:20.540
That's why I want to send you

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:25.296
the entire TPH collection
to use in your classes.

00:03:25.296 --> 00:03:29.650
Including, we have two
new products coming out.

00:03:29.650 --> 00:03:34.400
We have a masking and relaxing
charcoal mask for the scalp

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:39.130
and we also have no brass,
which is the blue toner

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:40.780
for when you're dying your hair.

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:44.040
So you will be the first
to get the two new products

00:03:44.040 --> 00:03:46.220
included with the larger line.

00:03:46.220 --> 00:03:48.000
And I'm also gonna reach
out to you personally

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:50.790
for something else coming from
me personally, a check baby.

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:51.673
So stay tuned.

00:03:53.060 --> 00:03:54.620
Okay?

00:03:54.620 --> 00:03:57.060
For me, TPH is a labor of love.

00:03:57.060 --> 00:03:59.680
So I know entrepreneurship isn't easy.

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:02.700
But when you have passion, drive,

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:05.010
and dedication and pour your blood, sweat

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:08.160
and tears into it, anything is possible.

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:11.070
Please keep going, Queens. Please.

00:04:11.070 --> 00:04:12.460
I'm gonna get your information.

00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:13.950
I got some more stuff coming for you.

00:04:13.950 --> 00:04:15.060
I love you so much.

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:16.303
- Thank you so much.

00:04:17.210 --> 00:04:18.260
- [TARAJI] Take care.

